  retrato: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4f24f54b42167ca448c6654f532206e8, type: 3}
  dayGreeting:
  - "I don\u2019t really like going for walks during the day. My skin is very sensitive."
  - "What? I don\u2019t want to grow old too soon. I\u2019m too handsome."
  nightText: I do like going for walks at night. Got a problem with that?
  partyText: I put on extra sunscreen today, specially made for me by Carl. It stings
    a little.
